WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.836
♪♪

00:00:03.836 --> 00:00:05.371
Let's get to the news.

00:00:05.371 --> 00:00:07.841
Following the news
that Kentucky Derby winner

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:11.044
Medina Spirit had failed
a post-race drug test,

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:13.446
former President Trump
released a statement

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.848
on his website yesterday,
that said,

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:17.850
"So now even our
Kentucky Derby winner,

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:21.388
Medina Spirit, is a junky,"
which brings us to a segment

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:23.922
called
"Dammit, That's Really Funny."

00:00:23.922 --> 00:00:27.760 line:0%
[ Theme music plays ]

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:30.330
Okay, obviously,
I dislike this man.

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.965
But it is possible
to dislike someone

00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:37.737
and think calling a horse
a junkie is very, very funny.

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:40.506
This was an official statement
from the former president,

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:43.343
calling a horse a junkie.

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:46.212
As if it bought the drugs itself
in some back alley.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.715
Like it only got caught
'cause the horse's parents

00:00:48.715 --> 00:00:51.718
found it in a shoebox
under its bed, its stable?

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.821
Again, I cannot stress enough,
I do not like this man.

00:00:55.821 --> 00:00:59.559
But, dammit, it's really funny.

00:00:59.559 --> 00:01:03.329 line:0%
-This has been...

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.498
-Maryland Governor Larry Hogan
criticized

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:07.566
his fellow Republicans
in an interview yesterday

00:01:07.566 --> 00:01:09.836
for continuing to support
former President Trump,

00:01:09.836 --> 00:01:13.505
and said, "It just bothers me
that you have to swear fealty

00:01:13.505 --> 00:01:15.875
to the dear leader, or you get
kicked out of the party."

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:17.844
If only there was a way

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:21.047
that we could have
seen all of this coming.

00:01:21.047 --> 00:01:23.616
Republican Congressman
Adam Kinzinger

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:26.586
yesterday criticized the GOP
for the ongoing debate

00:01:26.586 --> 00:01:28.922
whether to remove
Conference Chair Liz Cheney,

00:01:28.922 --> 00:01:31.657
and said the party is
"basically the Titanic."

00:01:31.657 --> 00:01:33.092
I don't know, though.

00:01:33.092 --> 00:01:36.996
When the "Titanic" went down,
people tried to get off it.

00:01:36.996 --> 00:01:38.431
"Women and children first,

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:41.534
and then we party,
right, gentlemen?"

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:44.670
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
signed new voting restrictions

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:46.572
into law last week
at the airport Hilton

00:01:46.572 --> 00:01:48.007
in West Palm Beach,

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.743
and only allowed Fox News
to broadcast the event.

00:01:50.743 --> 00:01:53.146
Also, the airport Hilton
in West Palm Beach

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:55.882
is now Florida's
only polling place.

00:01:55.882 --> 00:01:58.885
According to reports, Microsoft
co-founder Bill Gates' wife,

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:00.853
Melinda, may have filed
for divorce

00:02:00.853 --> 00:02:03.022
over concerns about her
husband's previous dealings

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:04.824
with sex trafficker
Jeffrey Epstein.

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:09.828
Wow, even Bill Gates has trouble
clearing his history.

00:02:09.828 --> 00:02:10.930
According to Politico,

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.566
87-year-old Iowa Senator
Chuck Grassley

00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.334
gets up at 4:00 am every day,

00:02:15.334 --> 00:02:19.205
as well as 5:15, 6:00 am,
6:45, and 7:10.

00:02:19.205 --> 00:02:20.706
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.706 --> 00:02:23.543
That's right, 87-year-old
Iowa Senator Chuck Grassley

00:02:23.543 --> 00:02:25.043
gets up at 4:00 am every day

00:02:25.043 --> 00:02:28.614
and often goes for a two-mile
run and does push-ups.

00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:30.783
Said Grassley, "I do?"

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:32.185
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:34.019
The manager of a movie theater
in Minnesota

00:02:34.019 --> 00:02:36.522
was recently arrested
for allegedly selling cocaine

00:02:36.522 --> 00:02:39.792
alongside popcorn,
and was pretty brazen about it.

00:02:39.792 --> 00:02:42.462
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.462 --> 00:02:45.865
A small sketch of a bear
by Leonardo da Vinci,

00:02:45.865 --> 00:02:47.766
measuring less
than 8 square inches,

00:02:47.766 --> 00:02:49.568
is expected to sell
at an auction

00:02:49.568 --> 00:02:53.873
for over $16 million,
which is way too high

00:02:53.873 --> 00:02:58.077
because da Vinci was originally
trying to draw a dog.

00:02:58.077 --> 00:02:59.278
[ Italian accent ]
It's no good.

00:02:59.278 --> 00:03:01.314
"No, it's very good."

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:03.483
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:04.483
It's a bear?

00:03:04.483 --> 00:03:06.052
"It's a dog!"

00:03:06.052 --> 00:03:08.187
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.187 --> 00:03:11.456
Finally, yesterday was singer
Billy Joel's 72nd birthday.

00:03:11.456 --> 00:03:13.292
And, this time, he did

00:03:13.292 --> 00:03:14.827
almost start the fire.

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:16.428
♪♪

00:03:16.428 --> 00:03:17.463
According to reports,

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.131
President Biden has yet to have

00:03:19.131 --> 00:03:21.301
a medical checkup
since taking office,

00:03:21.301 --> 00:03:23.936
but only because the doctor
has been too busy

00:03:23.936 --> 00:03:25.471
treating bite wounds.

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:27.640
[ Laughter ]
That's right, President Biden

00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:30.275
has yet to have a medical
checkup since taking office.

00:03:30.275 --> 00:03:31.410
Alright, let's relax.

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:32.912
It's been four months.

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:35.547
Besides, at his age,
a medical checkup is just

00:03:35.547 --> 00:03:37.883
you show up, you pass.

00:03:37.883 --> 00:03:41.221
McDonald's will release
new McCafé cups later this year

00:03:41.221 --> 00:03:42.855
that include
vaccination information

00:03:42.855 --> 00:03:46.292
and federal health slogans
to promote vaccine confidence.

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:48.094
Something like,
"What are you worried about?

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:49.629
You eat here."

00:03:49.629 --> 00:03:52.065
[ Laughter ]
Federal investigators
have reportedly asked

00:03:52.065 --> 00:03:53.866
a former Capitol Hill intern

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:56.636
who dated Florida
Representative Matt Gaetz

00:03:56.636 --> 00:03:59.639
to cooperate with their
investigation into allegations

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:02.175
that Gaetz was involved
in sex trafficking

00:04:02.175 --> 00:04:06.579 line:0%
and, apparently, he still
hasn't learned his lesson.

00:04:06.579 --> 00:04:08.481 line:0%
The U.S. Mint
yesterday announced

00:04:08.481 --> 00:04:12.452
it will release a new series
of quarters honoring 20 women,

00:04:12.452 --> 00:04:16.255
including poet Maya Angelou
and astronaut Dr. Sally Ride.

00:04:16.255 --> 00:04:18.157
What an honor for those women

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:21.294
to be bounced into a SOLO cup
at a college party.

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:22.462
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.462 --> 00:04:24.597
The FDA announced yesterday
that teenagers

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:28.200
from 12 to 15 years old can get
the Pfizer coronavirus vaccine,

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:30.069
but only if they
can figure out how

00:04:30.069 --> 00:04:31.804
to sign up for an appointment
on the Inter--

00:04:31.804 --> 00:04:32.905
Oh, and they're all signed up.

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:34.506
Okay.

00:04:34.506 --> 00:04:36.308
The New York Post published
a list yesterday

00:04:36.308 --> 00:04:39.345
of "The 7 craziest,
over-the-top things"

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:42.147
Amazon founder Jeff Bezos
has purchased.

00:04:42.147 --> 00:04:43.449
Coming in at number 1,

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:44.650
a comb.

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.654
[ Laughter ]

00:04:47.654 --> 00:04:49.722
NBC announced yesterday
it would not air

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:51.090
next year's Golden Globes,

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:53.493
but only to make room
for their newest program...

00:04:55.928 --> 00:04:57.796
[ Laughter ]
Starbucks added a new

00:04:57.796 --> 00:05:00.766
strawberry funnel cake
frappuccino to its menu today,

00:05:00.766 --> 00:05:02.768
which features strawberry purée

00:05:02.768 --> 00:05:05.104
and pieces of powdered sugar
funnel cake,

00:05:05.104 --> 00:05:06.605
all for the low, low price

00:05:06.605 --> 00:05:07.874
of your foot.

00:05:07.874 --> 00:05:10.076
[ Laughter ]

00:05:10.076 --> 00:05:12.711
Actress Gwyneth Paltrow
revealed, in a new interview,

00:05:12.711 --> 00:05:15.113
that, every night,
during the coronavirus pandemic,

00:05:15.113 --> 00:05:18.518
she would drink
two quinoa whiskey cocktails.

00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:20.086
Stars!
They're just like

00:05:20.086 --> 00:05:21.153
nobody.

00:05:21.153 --> 00:05:23.356
[ Laughter ]
According to a new study,

00:05:23.356 --> 00:05:24.790
the best way
to regain your smell

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:26.425
after having the coronavirus is

00:05:26.425 --> 00:05:29.996
to sniff at least four
different odors twice a day

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:31.364
for several months

00:05:31.364 --> 00:05:32.431
or, ladies,

00:05:32.431 --> 00:05:33.699
just move in with him.

00:05:33.699 --> 00:05:35.634
[ Laughter ]

00:05:35.634 --> 00:05:38.437
Finally, a woman in Italy
was released from the hospital

00:05:38.437 --> 00:05:41.073
over the weekend,
after she was mistakenly given

00:05:41.073 --> 00:05:44.543
six doses of the
Pfizer coronavirus vaccine.

00:05:44.543 --> 00:05:46.011
Well, she wasn't released,

00:05:46.011 --> 00:05:47.546
so much as she blasted

00:05:47.546 --> 00:05:49.248
through the nearest wall.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:49.248 --> 00:05:50.850
♪♪

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:52.251
House Republicans voted today

00:05:52.251 --> 00:05:54.987
to remove GOP
Conference Chair Liz Cheney

00:05:54.987 --> 00:05:56.321
from her leadership position,

00:05:56.321 --> 00:05:59.058
but they're already claiming
it never happened.

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:00.560
After Congresswoman Liz Cheney

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:02.395
was voted out
of her leadership position,

00:06:02.395 --> 00:06:05.264
former President Trump
mocked her on his website,

00:06:05.264 --> 00:06:07.834
saying, "I look forward
to soon watching her

00:06:07.834 --> 00:06:12.304
as a paid contributor
on CNN or MSDNC,"

00:06:12.304 --> 00:06:13.539
said the business genius

00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:16.141
who calls in to Fox News
every day for free.

00:06:16.141 --> 00:06:18.778
Liz Cheney told reporters today
that she plans to do

00:06:18.778 --> 00:06:21.047
everything she can to make sure
former President Trump

00:06:21.047 --> 00:06:24.049
"never gets anywhere near
the Oval Office."

00:06:24.049 --> 00:06:25.050
Oh, you know what you could do?

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.251
Elect him.

00:06:26.251 --> 00:06:27.787
Former President Trump's

00:06:27.787 --> 00:06:29.721
acting Defense Secretary
Christopher Miller

00:06:29.721 --> 00:06:32.892
testified today before Congress
about the Pentagon's response

00:06:32.892 --> 00:06:35.394
to the January 6th
Capitol attack

00:06:35.394 --> 00:06:37.997
and said he was concerned
that sending troops

00:06:37.997 --> 00:06:39.965
would make it look like
a military coup,

00:06:39.965 --> 00:06:41.867
as opposed to what
it did look like --

00:06:41.867 --> 00:06:46.005
Free Donut Day at the
Krispy Kreme in Middle Earth.

00:06:46.005 --> 00:06:49.941
A rare deep-sea creature
called a Pacific Football Fish

00:06:49.941 --> 00:06:51.978
washed up on a Southern
California beach last week,

00:06:51.978 --> 00:06:56.048
and it already has
a Netflix special.

00:06:56.048 --> 00:06:58.417
Kentucky Derby winner
Medina Spirit

00:06:58.417 --> 00:07:00.987
will be allowed to compete
this weekend in the Preakness

00:07:00.987 --> 00:07:02.221
despite failing a drug test.

00:07:02.221 --> 00:07:04.290
The horse will be in stall 6

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:07.026
next to my middle school
bus driver.

00:07:07.026 --> 00:07:09.362
According to a new survey,
people in the Northeast

00:07:09.362 --> 00:07:10.729
were the most likely to use Zoom

00:07:10.729 --> 00:07:12.265
to communicate
a pandemic breakup.

00:07:12.265 --> 00:07:15.901 line:0%
In fact, they even
made it a feature.

00:07:15.901 --> 00:07:19.372 line:0%
A Swedish robotics company
recently unveiled

00:07:19.372 --> 00:07:23.909
a battery-operated glove
that can protect factory workers

00:07:23.909 --> 00:07:27.913
from chronic injury caused
by repetitive manual tasks.

00:07:27.913 --> 00:07:33.151
"Tell me more,"
said teenage boys.

00:07:33.218 --> 00:07:35.021
"Tell me more,"

00:07:35.021 --> 00:07:39.958
famously a catchphrase
of our nation's teenagers.

00:07:39.958 --> 00:07:42.128
"Tell me more."

00:07:42.128 --> 00:07:44.229
And finally,
New York Governor Andrew Cuomo

00:07:44.229 --> 00:07:46.031
announced plans this week
to roll out

00:07:46.031 --> 00:07:48.133
pop-up coronavirus
vaccination sites

00:07:48.133 --> 00:07:49.935
at trains and subway stations,

00:07:49.935 --> 00:07:51.470
because you're not
a real New Yorker

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:54.506
until you've been poked
by a needle on the subway.

00:07:54.506 --> 00:07:56.208
♪♪

00:07:56.208 --> 00:07:58.644
You guys, I'm not
a superstitious man.

00:07:58.644 --> 00:08:00.679
All I'm saying is that Biden

00:08:00.679 --> 00:08:02.648
took one picture
with Jimmy Carter,

00:08:02.648 --> 00:08:04.684
and now there's a crisis
in the Middle East,

00:08:04.684 --> 00:08:07.520
a gasoline shortage,
and low-rise jeans are back.

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:09.121
I don't want to be
disrespectful,

00:08:09.121 --> 00:08:11.590
but he might be a leprechaun.

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.492
[ As Biden ]
Let me get a picture
with you, Jimmy.

00:08:13.492 --> 00:08:15.227
[ Irish accent ]
Oh, you'll get the picture,
alright!

00:08:15.227 --> 00:08:17.196
Take it down!

00:08:17.196 --> 00:08:20.465
The Colonial Pipeline
restarted operations yesterday,

00:08:20.465 --> 00:08:22.901
five days after being shut down
by a cyberattack,

00:08:22.901 --> 00:08:26.205
which is good because we were
reaching dangerous levels

00:08:26.205 --> 00:08:29.175
of smugness in Tesla owners.

00:08:29.175 --> 00:08:31.243
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy yesterday

00:08:31.243 --> 00:08:33.312
pushed back against claims

00:08:33.312 --> 00:08:36.582
that Republicans are still
focused on the 2020 election

00:08:36.582 --> 00:08:39.084
and said, "I don't think anybody

00:08:39.084 --> 00:08:42.621
is questioning the legitimacy
of the presidential election."

00:08:42.621 --> 00:08:44.924
Added McCarthy, "And I think
Vice President Biden

00:08:44.924 --> 00:08:46.625
would agree with that."

00:08:46.625 --> 00:08:48.060
That's right,
Kevin McCarthy said that

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:51.062
no one is questioning the
legitimacy of the 2020 election.

00:08:51.062 --> 00:08:52.932
Then he said, "Oh,
that's my phone.

00:08:52.932 --> 00:08:56.401
Who do I know in Florida?
Oh."

00:08:56.401 --> 00:08:58.437
The New York Yankees
announced yesterday

00:08:58.437 --> 00:09:00.906
that at least seven members
of the coaching staff

00:09:00.906 --> 00:09:03.041
have tested positive
for the coronavirus

00:09:03.041 --> 00:09:05.544
despite all receiving
the vaccine.

00:09:05.544 --> 00:09:07.313
And that's weird because,
usually,

00:09:07.313 --> 00:09:08.947
when Yankees get injections,

00:09:08.947 --> 00:09:10.049
they work.

00:09:11.984 --> 00:09:15.587
Wally, did you get that one,
Wally? Did you get it?

00:09:15.587 --> 00:09:17.856
-No.

00:09:17.856 --> 00:09:20.893
-When asked the median price
for a home in Brooklyn,

00:09:20.893 --> 00:09:22.528
former City Housing Commissioner

00:09:22.528 --> 00:09:24.863
and New York mayoral candidate
Shaun Donovan

00:09:24.863 --> 00:09:26.999
vastly underestimated the cost

00:09:26.999 --> 00:09:30.168
and said that the average price
of a home is $80,000 to $90,000,

00:09:30.168 --> 00:09:34.105
which, in his defense,
is the average price of a home

00:09:34.105 --> 00:09:37.676
for your car in Brooklyn.

00:09:37.676 --> 00:09:39.044
According to a new study,

00:09:39.044 --> 00:09:41.780
the coronavirus can stay
in men's genitals

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:44.149
for a long period of time
after recovery.

00:09:44.149 --> 00:09:46.919
Said men, "Challenge accepted."

00:09:46.919 --> 00:09:51.189
[ Laughter ]

00:09:51.189 --> 00:09:52.991
According to a new report,
the United States

00:09:52.991 --> 00:09:54.993
is experiencing
a chicken shortage

00:09:54.993 --> 00:09:59.031
because roosters are not meeting
breeding expectations.

00:09:59.031 --> 00:10:02.735
Said roosters,
"You told people?"

00:10:02.735 --> 00:10:05.070
[ Laughter ]

00:10:05.070 --> 00:10:07.907
And finally,
Swedish furniture retailer IKEA

00:10:07.907 --> 00:10:09.875
announced yesterday
that it will offer --

00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:12.678
it will offer
a pulled-pork sandwich

00:10:12.678 --> 00:10:13.845
in its restaurants,

00:10:13.845 --> 00:10:16.415
if you have the patience
to put it together.

00:10:16.415 --> 00:10:18.250 line:0%
That, you guys, was a monologue.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:20.286 line:0%
♪♪

00:10:20.286 --> 00:10:21.754 line:0%
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

